<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-coturnix-japonica-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 22.42 µm on Holocene Coturnix japonica plumage — Morphological realism / specimen match: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The comparison figure places the Yehliu quail, its plumage crop, the simulated activator, the dispersion curve, the Du sweep, and the equal-diffusion control on one page. The growth GIF is 12 frames at 960×540. Last-frame CV similarity to the photograph is 96.0 because the concrete and straw stay put and only plumage high frequencies are replaced. Deduction: the portrait is not a follicle micrograph and has no scale bar, so the resemblance is texture-class plus silhouette, not a micron overlay." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
